{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0ZpbG0lMjBDbHViJTIwJTI4MjAyNSUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Film Club","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/5koeXuj7klU2vfVEbLqYUfd0gqK.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fFJigkZ4QoI0MFO1ZN3tKSn2Xnl.jpg","description":"Friday night. 7pm. Film Club Week 198. Evie hasn't left the house in six months after a 'wobble', and Film Club is her escape. A weekly chance to create a world of wonder, deck the garage out in whatever the movie calls for and spend a few uninterrupted hours with Noa - her best friend and one of the few mates who still shows up. But tonight, things are different. Noa's got big news. A dream job is taking him across the other side of the country, which means that all of this is ending.\n\nCanceled · First aired 7 Oct 2025 · United Kingdom · Language: English · 30 min\nStudio: Gaumont, BBC · Network: BBC Three\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 6/6\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2025","genres":["Drama","Comedy","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0ZpbG0lMjBDbHViJTIwJTI4MjAyNSUyOS8.1.1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2025-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Best friends Evie and Noa have watched films together since they first met. But now Noa has news which is set to change everything.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/32Ftbaioy4qLgOLRYiCLyzMHDpO.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0ZpbG0lMjBDbHViJTIwJTI4MjAyNSUyOS8.1.2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2025-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"While Noa attends a taster day for his new job in Bristol, Evie pulls out all the stops for Film Club – there's a lot riding on tonight.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zChk5OmjqQYWj8wUadWuaMPttXP.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0ZpbG0lMjBDbHViJTIwJTI4MjAyNSUyOS8.1.3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2025-10-14T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Evie's still reeling from the message she saw on Noa's phone. But when the two are left alone together, something extraordinary happens. Is it the start of a new journey for Evie?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3FvCfHFjDUbWkLfAvuVDqDRtteD.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0ZpbG0lMjBDbHViJTIwJTI4MjAyNSUyOS8.1.4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2025-10-14T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"While Evie throws herself headlong at life, Suz and Josh worry it's too much, too soon. Meanwhile, Noa realises he has to face up to his feelings...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xbTkgQ5fPeux9StNyPAG9UJmzDK.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0ZpbG0lMjBDbHViJTIwJTI4MjAyNSUyOS8.1.5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2025-10-21T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Her world rocked, Evie has retreated to the safety of the garage. But with a new understanding, Suz and Izzie create a unique version of Film Club to bring back Evie's smile.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eNsWNSOyfxcj4ZIk4icxl1P2ScM.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0ZpbG0lMjBDbHViJTIwJTI4MjAyNSUyOS8.1.6","title":"Episode 6","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2025-10-21T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Noa didn't want a big goodbye, but now the day's finally come for him to leave, will Evie let him go that easily? It's not the only big decision she has to face...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3JjUrGmI9RSdh1gRy7v7rAAmDv8.jpg"}],"imdbRating":"6.3","runtime":"30 min","cast":["Aimee Lou Wood","Nabhaan Rizwan","Suranne Jones","Adam Long","Liv Hill","Owen Cooper","Ralph Davis"],"director":["Aimee Lou Wood","Ralph Davis"],"released":"2025-10-07T00: